OL,3,GNEWSARail disaster of 1957 marked by St
OL,4,AJohn's plaque
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plaque was unveiled at a ceremony
OL,7,Fat on Saturday, which included
OL,8,Fspeeches, a local choir, readings and
OL,9,Fmusic.
